# No agent attribution

This repository forbids agent, model, and vendor credit in git and GitHub metadata.

- Never leave `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `cursoragent@cursor.com`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or similar trailers in commits or PRs.
- After every commit, verify with `git log -1 --format=%B` before push.
- If Cursor injects attribution, strip or amend before push. Do not merge contaminated history.
- Do not use Cursor Cloud Agents for commits/PRs here; their co-author trailer is server-side and not user-disableable.
